        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Uvuguuti vwa Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyima wi ing'inga engekeeke, mwami Daudi yingilira Vafilisitia, kandi, navaguuta. Yavugula lidaala linene lia Gazi harara nu tudaala twalikumbiriza, kutura mu vwamihi vwavo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yaguuta vandu va Moabu avamanya nivagwa avatumikiri veve kandi nivatunga uvusuuru ku ye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Daudi yingilira nu kuguuta mwami Hadadezeri wa Zoba, kilala ku vivala via Siria, ahimbi ni kivala cha Hamazi, kigira mwami Hadadezeri yaali nageriza kuvugura uvwamihi vwi kivala keveeye iluhia wu mugera gwa Efurate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Daudi yamunyaga magare gu vulwani 1,000 avasikari vu kuniina ku zibarasi 7,000, na avasikari vo kogenda ku virenge 20,000. Yaleka zibarasi ziduukanaa kuhila magare gu vulwani 100, navuzwa yakalaga izindi ziosi amaki nazikola ni zilema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa vandu va Siria vamenya Damasiko vaatuma liihi kuzia kokonya Hadadezeri mwami wa Zoba, Daudi yavingilira niyiita avasaza 22,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku yamanya nalomba hokososa ha mahi mu kivala chavo, na vaagwa avatumikiri veve kandi nivamutungira uvusuuru. Yahova yakola Daudi kuva muguuti hoosi ha yazizaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yavugula zinguva zie zahabu zia vanene va Hadadezeri vaali nazio ma nivazihila Jerusalemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yavugula kandi mugasa munyingi kutura Tibuhazi na Kuni, madaala manene gamifwaa na Hadadezeri. Lwinyima, Solomoni yatumikira mugasa yigu okolomba lidangi lia mazi, zitiru kandi viju viu mugasa viu mu Litembeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Toi wa Hamazi yahulira ndi Daudi yaali kuguuta liihe liosi lia Hadadezeri mwami wa Zoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa yatuma muyaayi weve Joramu kuzia kucheliza mwami Daudi kandi kumuha lizominywa kigira uvuguuti vwivwe ku Hadadezeri, uwa Toi yaali niyalwaana naye haali kanyingi. Joramu yaleetera Daudi vihaanwa vinyingi vialombwa kutura ku zahabu, Ifeza kandi mugasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Daudi yavika viju zana halovega kulwuvutumiki vwa Yahova mu lisigamira harara ni feza, ni zahabu ya yavugula kutura mu zihiiri zia yaguuta - Edomu, Moabu, Amoni, Filisitia, na Vamaleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishai, uwa mama weve yaali Zeruya yaguuta Vaedomu mu Livona lie Ijumbi kandi niyiita vandu 18,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yasingiriza hokososa ha mahi geege mu Edomu mwosi, kandi avandu vamenya yo vaagwa avatumikiri va Daudi. Yahova yakola Daudi umuguuti havundu hoosi ha yazizaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yamiha ku vandu va Isiraeli vosi kandi nalora ndi avandu veve vakolerwa vulahi kandi nu kukalagirwa nu vulungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joabu, muyaayi wa Zeruya, yaali munene wi liihe; Jehoshafati muyaayi wa Ahiludi yavikwa kuva umung'odi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zadoku muyaayi wa Ahitubu kandi Ahimeleki muyaayi wa Abiazari vaali avasaalisi Seraya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Seraya:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Henza 2 Samweli 8:17 mu Luheburaina ni Shevisha - Lieta liu mulala ku avatumikiri va Daudi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yaali mung'odi wi kiyaalo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya muyaayi wa Jehoyada yaali munene ku vakerefi na vaperezi na avayaayi vu mwami Daudi vaali ni miyinzi ji igulu mu vutumiki vwavo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
